# oracle: fix npt (aniso) with thermo_modify press of the fix's own pressure compute: its kinetic part takes the temperature fix nh computed in final_integrate, before the thermostat rescaled the velocities (native's temperature->scalar, invoked this step)
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=none rel=1e-10 abs=1e-12
units lj
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 0.8442
region box block 0 4 0 4 0 4
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 1.0
velocity all create 1.5 87287 loop geom
pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff 1 1 1.0 1.0 2.5
neighbor 0.3 bin
fix 1 all npt temp 1.5 1.2 0.5 aniso 1.0 1.5 2.0
thermo_style custom step temp pe etotal press vol pxx pyy pzz
thermo_modify press 1_press
thermo_modify format float %.15g
thermo 20
run 200
